首先，分析依赖关系图：
1. task_001 → task_002 → task_003 → task_004 → task_005 → (task_008, task_009) → task_010
2. task_002 → task_006 → task_007 → task_010

所以关键路径是：task_001 → task_002 → task_003 → task_004 → task_005 → task_008/task_009 → task_010

